<title>POLAND: Poland C/A deficit $425 mln in Oct vs $358 mln Nov.</title>
<headline>Poland C/A deficit $425 mln in Oct vs $358 mln Nov.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Poland had a current account deficit of $425 million in October bringing the shortfall in the January-October period to $859 million, the National Bank of Poland said.</p>
</text>
